{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12346","headline":"奉陪郭常侍宴滻川山池 · 钱起","name":"奉陪郭常侍宴滻川山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掖垣携爱客，胜地赏年光。\n向竹过宾馆，寻山到妓堂。\n歌声掩金谷，舞态出平阳。\n地满簪裾影，花添兰麝香。\n莺啼春未老，酒冷日犹长。\n安石风流事，须归问省郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}